~ start
if quest_complete()
	Minerva: The mushroom was exactly what I needed. Come back when you want company.
	=> END
elif quest_started() and has_items()
	Minerva: You found it. Give it here.
	if turn_in()
		Minerva: Wonderful. Take this for your trouble, {{reward_text()}}.
	=> END
elif quest_started()
	Minerva: Still no mushroom? Keep looking.
	=> END
else
	=> offer

~ offer
Minerva: I need a mushroom. Will you find one for me?
- I'll look for it.
	do start_quest()
	Minerva: Good. Don't eat it.
	=> END
- Not right now.
	Minerva: Then go away, I'm busy.
	=> END